      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can now generate and edit images using natural language in GitHub Copilot.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When you ask for an image, your selected reasoning model calls a dedicated image-generation tool powered by GPT Image 2.5 Flare, previews the result inline, and saves it to your project.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Previously, getting a visual asset while working in Copilot meant stepping away to a separate tool, describing what you needed again, generating it there, and manually bringing it back into your project.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Describe an image conversationally in any Copilot chat session, whether you&rsquo;re starting a new request or in the middle of a coding task.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot previews the generated image inline and saves it directly to your workspace.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Organization and enterprise owners can turn off image generation by disabling the image generation model using Copilot model policies .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can opt in to a visible &ldquo;Made with AI&rdquo; watermark on images Copilot generates and edits.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To try it, open a Copilot chat in VS Code, the GitHub Copilot app, or Copilot CLI and describe the image you want.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Image generation is in public preview for Copilot Pro, Copilot Pro+, Copilot Business, and Copilot Enterprise.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It&rsquo;s billed separately from your chat model, based on image tokens that count toward your plan&rsquo;s AI credits.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-generate-and-edit-images-directly-in-copilot",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.125Z"
      },
      {
